   "title": "Period",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Period }{\\frac\\pi2}\\text{. Asymptotes where}\\\\[5pt]&{2x=\\frac\\pi2+n\\pi\\Rightarrow x=\\frac\\pi4+\\frac{n\\pi}2}\\text{ (so}\\\\[5pt]&{x=\\pm\\frac\\pi4,\\pm\\frac{3\\pi}4,\\dots}\\text{). Zeros at }{x=\\frac{n\\pi}{2}}\\text{.}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Extra points: }{x=\\frac\\pi8\\Rightarrow y=2\\tan\\frac\\pi4=2}\\text{;}\\\\[5pt]&{x=-\\frac\\pi8\\Rightarrow y=-2}\\text{.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
